cff-version: 1.2.0
title: "OpenHydro Bench (benchmark1d2d): open V&V benchmarks for hydraulic models"
message: "If you use this software, please cite it using the metadata from this file."
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Jeffers
    given-names: Scott
repository-code: "https://github.com/scott-jeffers/benchmark1d2d"
url: "https://scott-jeffers.github.io/benchmark1d2d"
license: Apache-2.0
version: "0.5.0"
date-released: "2026-10-15"
abstract: >-
  An open, engine-agnostic suite for verifying and validating 1D, 2D and
  coupled 1D/2D hydraulic solvers against exact solutions, laboratory
  measurements and the EPA SWMM / EPANET reference engines, with signed
  score cards for every result and a route for developers of other codes to
  submit theirs.
keywords:
  - verification
  - validation
  - SWMM
  - EPANET
  - shallow water
  - hydraulics
  - benchmark
